    <briefdescription>
<para>A name prepared for a single TAP line, without a copy when it needs no change. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The names of the suites and of the test cases rarely contain a character that <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1anonymous__namespace_02reporter-tap_8cpp_03_1aec79a35b7936b91bee63d9baf4f8c861" kindref="member">tap_text()</ref></computeroutput> changes, so the name is searched, and only copied (with <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacemicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1anonymous__namespace_02reporter-tap_8cpp_03_1aec79a35b7936b91bee63d9baf4f8c861" kindref="member">tap_text()</ref></computeroutput>) when it must be changed; otherwise <computeroutput><ref refid="classmicro__os__plus_1_1micro__test__plus_1_1detail_1_1anonymous__namespace_02reporter-tap_8cpp_03_1_1tap__name_1af66d5eee86e8fa54fb3d8f36177fb60b" kindref="member">c_str()</ref></computeroutput> returns the original name, which must outlive the object. The object is neither copyable nor movable. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
